      <p>
        <anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR455_0_255_014"/>Dancke lieber Engel für <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR455_0_note_001_255_14" xml:id="start_com_3718"/>das überschickte<ref xml:id="end_com_3718"/>. Geben Sie <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR455_0_note_002_255_14" xml:id="start_com_3719"/>innliegendes<ref xml:id="end_com_3719"/> an 
<anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR455_0_255_015"/>
        <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR455_0_note_003_255_15" xml:id="start_com_3720"/>Ernsten<ref xml:id="end_com_3720"/>. Und guten Tag.    d<g ref="#typoSuspension"/>. 14 Jan 79<ptr n="1" target="#a001_255.15"/>
      </p>
    </div>
    
